name outage_3s
describe 3 s outage (tunnel) in the middle of the call
duration 30s
at 0s  capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 12s down
at 15s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 12s down
reverse at 15s up
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms < 3300
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 4000
expect cc.max_settle_ms < 2000
